                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nami nitalileta fungu lile la tatu na kulipitisha kati ya moto, nami nitawasafisha kama fedha isafishwavyo, nami nitawajaribu kama dhahabu ijaribiwavyo; wataliitia jina langu, nami nitawasikia; mimi nitasema, Watu hawa ndio wangu; nao watasema, BWANA ndiye Mungu wangu.",
          "type": "text",
